<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Gray auxiliary robotic arm -->
  <Gray_Apparel_MechanitorBelt.label>灰裔“四向辅臂”四核协助机械臂</Gray_Apparel_MechanitorBelt.label>
  <!-- EN: The Four-Way Auxiliary Arm is a multifunctional expansion device commonly used by Gray mechanitors. As long as a part of oneself is injected into it, its four independent auxiliary cores can switch between manipulation, hauling, repair, or defense modes according to mission needs. All auxiliary arm movements are scheduled in real time by the secondary logic unit of the persona core, with almost no operational delay. After battle, one occasionally sees auxiliary arms that have detached from the main body due to damage yet still twitch—derisively called 'Gray Embers' by scavengers. -->
  <Gray_Apparel_MechanitorBelt.description>四向辅臂是灰裔机械师常用的多功能扩展装置。只要将自身的一部分注入其中，四组独立的辅助核心便可根据任务需求切换为操控、搬运、修复或防御模式，所有辅臂动作由人格核心的副逻辑单元即时调度，几乎无操作延迟。在战后，偶尔能见到因损坏脱离主体却还在动弹的辅臂，被那些垃圾佬戏称为“灰裔余烬”。</Gray_Apparel_MechanitorBelt.description>
  
</LanguageData>